allocations.jl</code> are unchanged,\nand every one of them still holds on Julia 1.12.7.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Merged pull requests:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Raise the Julia floor to 1.12 (#85) (@michakraus)</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Michael Kraus", "affiliation": "Max-Planck-Institut f\u00fcr Plasmaphysik"}, {"name": "benedict-96", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Th\u00e9o Duez", "affiliation": "CNRS"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/JuliaGNI/SymbolicNeuralNetworks.jl/tree/v0.9.1", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v0.9.1", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/JuliaGNI/SymbolicNeuralNetworks.jl"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 19, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "10866381"}}]}}, "title": "JuliaGNI/SymbolicNeuralNetworks.jl: v0.9.1", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23624404", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23624404?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23624404", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23624404", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23624404", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10866381", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10866381", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10866381", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.10866381", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23624404/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23624404/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23624404/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-24T18:56:46.191819+00:00", "recid": "23624404", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "bd9646c7-f882-4e4d-a6d1-21039462cb90", "key": "JuliaGNI/SymbolicNeuralNetworks.jl-v0.9.1.zip", "size": 185710, "checksum": "md5:2072c054bf869b28d92179af82c63d26", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624404/files/JuliaGNI/SymbolicNeuralNetworks.jl-v0.9.1.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "85957"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 123, "unique_downloads": 122, "views": 359, "unique_views": 356, "version_downloads": 0, "version_unique_downloads": 0, "version_unique_views": 0, "version_views": 0}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-24T18:48:52.052814+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-24T18:48:52.241104+00:00", "id": 23623866, "conceptrecid": "23623865", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23623866", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23623865", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23623866", "metadata": {"title": "Collective Model Fusion with CIGAR for EIS-Based Lithium-Ion Battery SoH Estimation", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23623866", "publication_date": "2026-10-24", "description": "<p>The implementation serves as a compact demonstration of collective model fusion with CIGAR for lithium-ion battery state-of-health (SoH) estimation using electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS). It reproduces the main preprocessing, model-training, and fusion steps in a reduced workflow, but is not intended to reproduce the dissertation results numerically. Instead, it provides an accessible example of the corresponding experimental procedure and supports reproducibility of the underlying methodology.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Olbrych-Nasuta, Sylwia", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0000-0002-5631-3845"}, {"name": "Tung, Zi Xuan", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Abdelrazeq, Anas", "affiliation": "RWTH Aachen University", "orcid": "0000-0002-8450-2889"}, {"name": "Schmitt, Robert H.", "affiliation": "RWTH Aachen University", "orcid": "0000-0002-0011-5962"}], "keywords": ["Machine learning", "Collective intelligence", "Electrochemical impedance spectroscopy", "Lithium-ion battery", "State of health"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1007/s00521-026-12144-6", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Sylwia-Olbrych/cigar_eis_soh_fusion", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "grants": [{"code": "03XP0364B", "internal_id": "04pz7b180::03XP0364B", "funder": {"name": "Federal Ministry of Education and Research"}, "title": "OptiPro: Optimierte Zellfinalisierung durch innovative Anlagentechnik und parametergest\u00fctzte Auswertung der Prozess- und Qualit\u00e4tsparameter im virtuellen Produktionssystem (Optimized cell finalization through innovative plant technology and parameter-based evaluation of process and quality parameters in the virtual production system)"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23623865"}}]}}, "title": "Collective Model Fusion with CIGAR for EIS-Based Lithium-Ion Battery SoH Estimation", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23623866", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23623866?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23623866", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23623866", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23623866", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623865", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23623865", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23623865", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23623865", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23623866/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23623866/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23623866/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23623866/communities", 